{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-1",
  "title": "Pillars",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "final",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Pillars"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-2",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**People** (users, clients, customers, partners, team, stakeholders, contacts, etc)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-3",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Organizations** (companies, teams, organizations, groups, etc)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-4",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Agents** (customizable AI agents, chatbots, etc; agents are part of the team along with people, and can be assigned to projects, tasks, etc)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-5",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Projects** (projects the organization is working on <model based on linear.app>)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-6",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Goals** (long-term ideals, with tools for thought, planning, and breaking down into actionable steps)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-7",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Milestones** (deadline markers for projects and/or goals)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-8",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Cycles** (a collection of tasks which are part of either a goal or a project)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-9",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Tasks** (actionable ticket which can belong to a sprint)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-10",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Services** (services provided by the organization + their details & pricing)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-11",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Events** (calendar events, scheduled payments, deadlines, meetings, etc)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-12",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Assets** (finances, assets, liabilities, budgets, predictions, etc; this is connected to everything, and automatically updates as things change)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-13",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Documents** (invoices, documentation, slide decks, etc)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-14",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Notes** (tagged notes written by humans)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-15",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Sketchbook** (interface for illustrating ideas and concepts)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-16",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Workflows** (automated workflows for tasks, events, etc; similar to zapier | n8n | [make.com](http://make.com/))"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-17",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Insights** (analytics, metrics, KPIs, etc; these are often generated by AI or other tools)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-18",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Tools** (tech stack, devtools, design tools, project mgmt tools, 3rd party tools & APIs, products & platforms, etc) >>> Keep track of tools, login credentials, subscription status, pricing, etc. This is one of several tables that will inform the asset table."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-19",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Integrations** (integrations with 3rd party tools, services, platforms, etc)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-20",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Conversations** (threads from slack, email, AI agent chats, meetings transcripts, etc)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-21",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Files** (documents, images, videos, etc)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-22",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Archive** (archived items, deleted items, etc; any item from any table can be archived. archived items are hidden from the UI, but can be restored; admins can permanently delete items with some confirmation)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}